---
description: Resolve which worker runs a crew stage and get the recommended dispatch command
{frontmatter_extra}---
<!-- lee-llm-router shim v1 sha256={marker_hash} -->

Execute the following command to resolve which worker should run this crew stage:

lee-llm-router resolve $ARGUMENTS --mode flex --harness {harness} --json

Parse the JSON output and display the following fields to the user:
- worker
- model
- effort
- headroom
- reason

Do not dispatch automatically, invoke any provider binary, or edit any files. Offer the following dispatch command for the user to run:

lee-llm-router dispatch --crew <crew> --role <role> --mode flex --harness {harness} --prompt-file <path>
